# `permissions.delete`

Remove a permission preset (scope omitted walks project → user).

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.permissions.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`ScopedMutation` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call permissions.delete --json '{ "id": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
